  Shared across both flavours.

  `app_name`, `title_activity_main`, `package_name` and `custom_url_scheme`
  are NOT here: each differs per app and lives in the flavour source sets
  under src/customer and src/partner. Leaving them here would collide with
  the flavour values and fail the build with a duplicate resource — which
  is the good failure. The bad one would be shipping the partner app
  called "Sambramo".

  `npx cap sync` rewrites this file from capacitor.config.json, so if the
  four names reappear here after a sync, they have to be removed again.
  scripts/capacitor-config.mjs prints a reminder.
